      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nfaS9vjq2Wu5GonnDUIOhRL2y6pnzLaoMqhU-6dfu7LLR1aLU8I2-k3XCvlqvcw0YKRQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Loved their food when I was traveling there.   Portugueses can  give Japaneses run for their money when it comes to fish consumption.",
